msgid "Step 4: Analyze Gaussian hill depositions"
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:75
msgid ""
"Let’s explore how TTMetaD and WTMetaD deposit Gaussian hills differently. "
"You can extract the Gaussian hills from the HILLS file for both TTMetaD and "
"WTMetaD and visualize the different 2D PMFs at various time points. The "
