msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:77
msgid ""
"![Hill height deposition – WTMetaD vs. "
"TTMetaD.](figs/ttmetad_vs_wtmetad.jpg)"
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:79
msgid ""
"We have provided the data and Python scripts for visualization on the "
"accompanying GitHub page, but we strongly recommend that you try to do this "
